id: pm-vcs-tjnr
title: Install the pinned release npm into a job-local prefix
description: "The release workflow replaces the runner's global npm with the pinned npm. Parallel jobs on one runner host share the toolcache Node installation, so one job's global install mutates a sibling job's npm mid-install (ENOTEMPTY, or npm: command not found). Tracked by unbraind/pm-ops#284."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-ops#284"
created_at: "2026-11-16T14:39:25.582Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-16T16:09:33.380Z"
author: pi-glm
acceptance_criteria: "The release workflow installs the pinned npm with --prefix into a job-local directory and prepends that prefix bin to the job path; The workflow keeps the exact-version assertion on the effective npm; A workflow-contract test fails if any workflow replaces the global npm; Gates pass: typecheck, lint, tests, changelog:check"
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T15:18:05.935Z",codex-sol,"Continuation: verified the existing worktree and remote branch state, preserved the earlier changes, and reused this item. Rerunning required gates to completion under the continuation author before committing results."
  "2026-11-16T15:28:55.474Z",codex-sol,"Root cause confirmed in the workflow source: global installation of the pinned npm replaces the same Node installation used by parallel jobs on a shared toolcache. Replaced each bootstrap with a job-local prefix, published only its bin directory to the job PATH, and retained exact-pin checks including a separate subsequent-step assertion. Workflow contracts reject global npm replacement across all workflow files. No runner settings or shared tool installations were modified."
  "2026-11-16T15:42:42.194Z",codex-sol,The first combined gate command hit its 20-minute timeout during shared-host disk contention and is not pass evidence. Retrying all gates to completion using memory-backed temporary fixtures and the existing harness deadline scale. Assertions and test selection are unchanged.
  "2026-11-16T15:59:12.342Z",codex-sol,"Gate results before publication: typecheck and lint completed successfully; node --test test/release-approval.test.ts and changelog:check passed together. The first npm test command timed out during disk contention; the full replacement run is active and remains pending evidence. Regenerated the required self-host bundle using the repository writer. Publishing a draft for exact-head CI validation."
  "2026-11-16T16:09:19.061Z",codex-sol,"Implementation commit 139bd057e9477e86251542deaf86e18a64f31be9 installs and verifies the release npm privately to each job. Typecheck, lint, workflow contracts and changelog checks passed. The first broad npm test attempt timed out; the full replacement remains active. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification and exact-head CI."
